    - target: {fileID: 1675962321474784320, guid: 3b8d5129b54c3124a8011397aec1f40f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Hello,

        I wanted to inform you that the delivery scheduled
        for later this week may unfortunately be delayed.

        One of the items
        included in the order, product ID 04504405 is currently out of stock at our
        warehouse. Our supplier expects the next batch to arrive early next week,
        which means the shipment to your office will likely be pushed back a few
        days.

        The rest of the order is already prepared, so once the missing
        item arrives we will dispatch everything together.

        If you would
        prefer that we ship the available items separately, just let me know and
        we can arrange that.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
